The baseline results are taken from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib59" title="" class="ltx_ref">Sahoo et al. (2025)</a></cite>.
For CADD, we report the bound on the discrete likelihood. Best diffusion value is <span id="A3.T5.fig2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bolded</span>. <sup id="A3.T5.fig2.4.2" class="ltx_sup">⋆</sup> the dataset for SEDD didn’t incorporate sentence packing.
